WEBVTT

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:42.120
M-mustached bastard...!

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:47.190
We finally reach the capital tomorrow.
That Keiro bastard is there...

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:49.930
Yes, that's why he's dreaming.

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:54.300
With the battle looming, his body is
remembering how terrifying Keiro was.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.070
Is Keiro that strong?

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.970
Taito has no chance
of winning as he is now.

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:02.700
I see.

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:06.860
Oh, wow!

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:08.960
What a huge city!

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:11.560
I'd expect no less from Luo Chang,
the capital of the Xian Empire!

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:13.120
This is like a dream!

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:17.370
We finally made it to the capital.

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:21.040
Taito. Won't you come to my place?

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:22.570
The Tong You Temple.

00:01:22.570 --> 00:01:26.380
Relieve the weariness of the journey first.
Everything can begin after that.

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:28.880
Right! Let's go!

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:32.310
Hurray! We'll get to meet
the girl Ryuko likes!

00:01:39.190 --> 00:01:40.390
He's here.

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:45.160
But he won't cause much
of a stir as he is now.

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:48.200
It's not every day the
Alkaid and Dubhe collide.

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:50.200
I'll need to make the boy stronger

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:54.660
by filling him with even more
ambition and hate and whatnot.

00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:59.900
I'm going to borrow this, Boss.

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:11.050
Whoa! Th-this is--!

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:13.620
It's huge! So huge!

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:16.790
This is a street, right? It is, right?!

00:02:16.790 --> 00:02:20.900
Is it really okay to have
such big streets?! Is it?!

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:22.920
Don't ask me...!

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:28.740
I can't believe it! I can't believe it!

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:32.370
A feast fit for a king,
right before my very eyes!

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:36.080
Is this paradise?! Is this heaven?!

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:38.750
Calm down, dumb brother.
You're embarrassing.

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:40.050
But...!

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:43.280
Don't cry. I know how you feel, but...

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:49.120
Let's go, Laila! You can buy
clothes or whatever else you want!

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:50.430
Wait, Taito!

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:53.960
Let's look for some souvenirs
for Dad and Grandpa Son too!

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:57.470
Souvenirs, huh? Does he
assume he'll be able to return?

00:02:57.470 --> 00:03:01.340
So, what are you gonna do now?

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:04.670
I'm not sure what I should do.

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:08.010
Oh. Well, I know what I'm gonna do.

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:13.280
Keiro's the boss of Shimei,
the guy who killed my master...

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:22.290
Welcome to Tong You Temple.

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:27.000
I am Ryusho, the head of the temple.
Ryuko has told me about you.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.130
It's a pleasure to meet you, Master Ryusho.

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:30.170
Thanks for helpin' us!

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:31.630
Yup, thanks!

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:36.540
Divine Warrior of Phecda, Hosei!

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:40.440
And you are Taito,
the Celestial Deity Alkaid!

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:42.380
Th-that's right...

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:45.480
You have a good look to you!

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:49.820
It looks like Master Sonnei
and Sir Soei raised you well.

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:53.890
--Huh?!
--You know Master Sonnei and our father?

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:55.160
Of course.

00:03:55.160 --> 00:04:01.200
Father studied under Master Sonnei,
and he and Senior Soei are like brothers.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:05.400
"Father"? Does that mean
this guy's your old man?

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:09.670
My stepfather, technically.
I was abandoned as a child.

00:04:09.670 --> 00:04:11.810
What?! Really?!

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:14.480
Oh, man. You too?

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:16.410
We're alike!

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:18.350
We're orphans, we grew up in temples,

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:20.720
and we carry the stars' karma or whatever!

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:22.820
Maybe that's why we get along so well!

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.850
Yes! Perhaps so!

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:29.390
Get along? I dunno, I'd say you're
more like, "Danger, do not mix!"

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:34.430
Y-yeah, now that you mention it,
I'm not sure if we get along or not...

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:35.900
--Which one is it?!
--Oh, come on, Taito!

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:38.070
You've gained friends, Ryuko.

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:39.500
Yes.

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:44.540
--You can use this room.
--Okay! Thanks!

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:46.730
My room is across the hall.

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:52.900
Who's there?!

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:01.460
Welcome back, Ryuko.

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:03.290
You look well.

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:06.860
Th-thank you. Y-you look well, too...

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:08.560
Oh, so that's it!

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:10.770
Oh! So she's...!

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:13.200
Wait, who are you?

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:20.410
I'm Rinmei, your personal attendant.
It's nice to meet you.

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:22.310
Nice to meet you!

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:24.480
So, Ryuko? Where's my souvenir?

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:25.610
Souvenir?!

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:28.650
O-oh, sorry, I don't have one...

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:33.660
Sheesh. Couldn't you at least say,
"My safe return is my present to you"?

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:36.490
Interesting! I didn't consider that possibility!

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:39.620
Thank you! That was
most educational, Rinmei!

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:44.730
Terrible. Isn't he?

00:05:44.730 --> 00:05:47.170
--Yes!
--For sure!

00:05:47.170 --> 00:05:52.570
Wh-what are you agreeing about?!
I don't see why he's terrible!

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:56.670
Are you serious? She's Ryuko's...

00:05:57.650 --> 00:06:01.080
Huh?! Ryuko's in love with her?!

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:03.250
H-hold on, Taito! What are you saying?!

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:09.290
I'm devoted to my training! I don't
have time to be crazy about g-g-girls!

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:11.690
--He says he isn't in love.
--Oh, geez...

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:18.260
Sheesh. Are you just like him, Taito?

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:28.510
How often I remembered
your cooking while journeying!

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:30.600
Is that all you remembered?

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:42.560
Are you all right, Rinmei? Are you--

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:53.900
R-Rinmei...

00:06:56.170 --> 00:06:58.160
Y-yes...?

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:02.200
Your pot is boiling over.

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:06.710
I'm going out to gather water!

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:12.390
Wh-what was that for, Rinmei...?

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:18.690
Whadya think, Hosei?
Muscle is what makes a man!

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:23.390
That's nothin'. I'm an archer.
Check out my shooting arm!

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:33.000
Check out my special technique! Leg Flex!

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.570
You can't beat me!

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:40.040
Taito! Hosei! I brought--

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:49.930
Just horrible! Unbelievable!

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:52.590
Honestly! How can someone
be so straightlaced?!

00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:53.730
Men are...

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:56.700
Men are so hopeless!

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:02.640
It looks like we'll get along well, Laila.

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:05.070
It does, Rinmei!

00:08:07.140 --> 00:08:08.630
Kindred spirit!

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:19.090
You're <i>still</i> eating, Taito?
Everyone else finished a long time ago.

00:08:19.090 --> 00:08:22.580
I can't help it!
Rinmei's cooking is too good!

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.590
Thanks for the meal!

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:35.970
Well, I should go now.

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:37.570
Huh? Where to?

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:41.280
Isn't it obvious?
To beat that mustached bastard!

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:44.650
That's the whole reason why I came here!

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:49.180
I won't be satisfied until I kick
the crap out of him for my friends' sake!

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:51.150
No! Don't, Taito!

00:08:51.150 --> 00:08:53.360
Huh?! What are you talking about?

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:57.160
You can't do it. You cannot
defeat Keiro as you are now!

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:58.190
What?!

00:08:58.190 --> 00:08:59.860
The difference in strength is obvious!

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:03.370
You should know that
more than anyone else!

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:05.670
There's no way to know unless I try!

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:07.540
I'm stopping you <i>because</i> I know!

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:09.840
He can't be beaten with spirit alone!

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:11.670
If you fight him now,
you'll die for nothing!

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:14.880
For nothing?! How can
you say that, Ryuko?!

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:17.110
Count me in.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:18.310
Hosei!

00:09:18.310 --> 00:09:22.620
I'm going too.
I want to avenge my master.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:26.320
We <i>are</i> Divine Warriors, Ryuko.

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:30.960
So isn't it logical to think that helping
Taito is in the karma of the stars?

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:32.360
You're wrong!

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:36.160
The Divine Warriors are meant to act
as breakwaters for the Alkaid and Dubhe!

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:38.530
--In which case...!
--Enough of this crap!

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:40.200
I'm gonna beat the mustached freak!

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:42.040
You can't tell me what to do!

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:44.470
Yeah! Butt out, Ryuko!

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:47.740
Taito... Hosei...

00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:52.680
Ah. I see words aren't enough
to talk reason into you.

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:55.880
So what do you say we let
our bodies do the talking?

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.510
Rinmei?!

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:01.260
Wh-what are you saying?!

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:04.190
I'll give you a personal lesson...

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:10.270
Come on! Why do I
have to do this with you?!

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:14.330
The night air is terrible for the skin.
Let's hurry and get this over with.

00:10:15.270 --> 00:10:17.340
The Lin Shan Hua...

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:19.330
...my other self!

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:30.350
Th-that pattern! Is she...?!

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:35.620
Yes. She is Rinmei,
the Divine Warrior of Merak!

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:44.730
I'm just a weak girl. Please don't
be too rough on me, Alkaid Taito...

00:10:50.070 --> 00:10:51.300
Here I come!

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:56.280
She's fast!

00:10:56.280 --> 00:11:00.040
Instantaneous body management.
That is Rinmei's fighting strategy!

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:07.320
I won't let a girl beat me!

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:18.790
Sh-she disappeared?!

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:26.430
Not bad. You could be
trouble in a drawn-out fight.

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:55.130
The Alkaid is a child.
You're a real handful.

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:06.280
I'm stronger than you, and Keiro
is most definitely stronger than me.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:09.480
Now do you understand what
"dying for nothing" means?

00:12:12.650 --> 00:12:15.690
Taito. You mustn't be hasty.

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:17.960
There is more than one way
to climb a mountain.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:20.560
There are other paths to the top.

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:25.370
If you have a just cause,
the heavens will show you a way.

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:28.400
Let us wait together
for that time to come.

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:31.410
Oh, well. Guess we'll have to
wait for another chance.

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:33.030
Yeah.

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:52.430
Tadah! Look! It's the flag for the
"Men Are So Hopeless League"!

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:54.560
It's good! It's really good!

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:57.070
It really gives off that male
"we're so hopeless" feeling!

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:59.060
Doesn't it, though?!

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:01.500
Kindred spirit!

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:03.160
Hey, Laila!

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:07.180
I-I didn't know you were like that, Laila!

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:09.010
Is that why you won't accept my love?

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:12.610
Oh, you have it all wrong!
It isn't like that!

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:15.720
Anyway, do you need something?

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:19.120
Yeah. I can't find Taito or Ryuko...

00:13:19.120 --> 00:13:21.420
Yeah, they left together.

00:13:21.420 --> 00:13:25.090
Together? They sure
have been friendly lately...

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:28.300
Oh! Have they awakened
to that sort of thing too?!

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:30.290
Of course not!

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:40.880
The capital's really something!

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:44.150
It's beautiful and rich,
nothing like any of the other towns!

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:46.310
This is only its exterior face, though.

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:48.750
Exterior face? What do you mean?

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:59.130
Hey, Ryuko. What is it
you want to show me?

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:03.670
Shunyi Square. Commonly
known as Keiro Square.

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:05.220
Keiro!

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:13.470
Th-that bastard made this hole?

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:18.850
The emperor held a martial arts
tournament here four years ago.

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:21.920
Keiro made this during it.

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:24.990
Barehanded, with one
punch from his left hand.

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:27.590
Barehanded?!

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:29.460
You don't think that he's--?!

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:34.800
Yes. Keiro is a master of
inner-channel Energy Manipulation.

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:36.800
So that's how it is!

00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:39.930
Taito. Master inner-channel
Energy Manipulation.

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:43.340
And then carve out an even
larger hole than Keiro.

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:47.310
Do that, and I won't have to lose a friend.

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:49.710
I brought you here to tell you that.

00:14:49.710 --> 00:14:51.610
Ryuko...

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:01.860
--Let's go, Taito.
--Huh?

00:15:01.860 --> 00:15:05.290
Hey, Ryuko. Where are we going?

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:08.660
Hey, Ryuko!

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:10.870
Wh-what is this place?!

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:14.200
Th-this can't be real!
The main street was so nice!

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:16.840
But just one alley away...

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:19.140
The imperial capital has light and darkness.

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:23.180
This is its hidden face.
No, its true face.

00:15:23.180 --> 00:15:24.710
Its true face?

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:28.320
The empire is currently utterly
deteriorated and impoverished.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:30.850
It's the same everywhere,
in the country and here in Luo Chang.

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:35.390
B-but it's the capital! This is right
under the emperor's nose!

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:37.360
What is the emperor doing?!

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:38.830
Nothing.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:43.770
Then why don't they kick him out
and let someone else be the emperor?!

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:47.070
Keiro is hoping to do just that.

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:51.370
Ugh, better <i>me</i> than that mustached bastard!

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:53.860
Ryuko!

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:58.850
Now where are we?

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:03.340
The execution grounds. We won't
cause any collateral harm here.

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:06.240
Show yourself!

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:12.890
Impressive, Mizar.

00:16:12.890 --> 00:16:16.400
I thought I was following you,
but I was being led instead.

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:17.400
You!

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:20.100
So that vile gaze <i>was</i> you!

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:23.090
Shimei! I'll kick your ass!

00:16:32.980 --> 00:16:36.150
You used another cheap
trick again, didn't you?!

00:16:36.150 --> 00:16:39.950
Whew, you're scary. I always
gotta be careful around you.

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:46.460
But no, I'm not here today to fight.
I came to have a chat with you, boy.

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:48.630
Remember this?

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:52.300
That's the sword he stole
from Lian Tong Temple!

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:55.770
The Xian Jia Lan Wu...
Commonly known as the Emperor's Sword.

00:16:55.770 --> 00:17:00.910
Only the one fit to be
the emperor can draw it.

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:05.150
My boss Keiro stole this
so he could make himself emperor.

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:10.150
Once drawn, everyone alive would
acknowledge his accession to the throne.

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:13.250
But he <i>couldn't</i> draw it.

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:14.460
So what?!

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:18.960
Don't you get it? Not even
the current emperor can draw it.

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:23.360
The only person in this world who can...

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:25.530
...is you!

00:17:32.310 --> 00:17:34.110
That's what I wanna discuss.

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:40.050
Is it possible you want to do something
about this utterly rotten empire?

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:44.220
If so, then why not become
the emperor and rule the land?

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:45.390
What?!

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:48.160
You drew the Xian Jia Lan Wu.

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:53.130
The heavens have approved!
They say you are the man to rule all!

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:56.150
Become the emperor!

00:17:57.370 --> 00:17:58.970
Shut up!

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:00.840
<i>I'll</i> make my own decisions!

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:04.900
I don't wanna listen
to any of your nonsense!

00:18:06.710 --> 00:18:08.710
Is that so?

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:10.140
In that case...

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:19.910
Die, boy!

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:28.590
If you won't entertain me,
then there's no reason for you to live!

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:38.160
Taito! Use inner-channel
Energy Manipulation!

00:18:56.020 --> 00:18:57.350
Taito!

00:18:59.590 --> 00:19:03.400
How fun! I'm never bored when I'm with you!

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:06.130
Let's meet again, Alkaid Taito!

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:16.580
The Xian Jia Lan Wu is gone!
Who could've taken it?!

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:19.050
What shall we do, Lord Keiro?!

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:22.620
Forget about it. It was
most likely Shimei's doing.

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:23.820
Shimei?

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:28.820
Is it wise to allow someone
so enigmatic to do as he pleases?

00:19:28.820 --> 00:19:31.590
It matters not.

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:34.060
<i>For now, at least</i>...

00:19:36.600 --> 00:19:41.070
A false world of Shimei's creation...

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:45.440
They know what we're up to now.
This will be tough...

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:49.340
Are you all right, Taito?

00:19:50.780 --> 00:19:52.110
Taito?

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:59.250
Me... be the emperor?

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:11.470
The six stars are gathering.

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:15.090
I guess I'll pay a visit to the capital too...

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:25.840
<i>Was their encounter</i>
<i>a trick of fate? Or was it</i>...

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:27.310
<i>I'm gonna see for myself!</i>

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:29.980
--<i>Don't, Taito!</i>
--<i>That idiot's actually gonna go</i>...

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:34.080
<i>Only bad guys eat food this good outside!</i>

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:35.250
<i>To pray</i>.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:38.460
<i>That is the divine duty of the emperor,</i>
<i>as ordained by the heavens</i>.

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:41.860
<i>I dunno, a country where</i>
<i>everyone can live with a smile</i>.

00:20:41.860 --> 00:20:45.930
<i>Taito's heated fists thaw a frozen heart!</i>

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:50.130
<i>On Hero Tales, "Chapter Ten:</i>
<i>The Lonely Emperor."</i>

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:05.280
<i>It's all because the emperor</i>
<i>doesn't give a damn!</i>
